OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Mon 21 Sep to Wed 30 Sep
OL,6,FThe first part of this period will
OL,7,Flikely see a build of pressure across
OL,8,Fmuch of the UK, with Atlantic weather
OL,9,Ffronts becoming more confined to
OL,10,Fnorthern and northwestern areas. As
OL,11,Fsuch, plenty of dry and increasingly
OL,12,Fwarm and perhaps rather humid weather
OL,13,Fwill develop, whilst the bulk of the
OL,14,Frain and possible strong winds are
OL,15,Fmore likely to affect the northwest of
OL,16,Fthe UK. Many areas may remain mostly
OL,17,Fsettled towards the end of September,
OL,18,Fbut there is the possibility of areas
OL,19,Fof low pressure moving in from the
OL,20,FAtlantic bringing more widely
OL,21,Funsettled conditions by the end of the
OL,22,Fmonth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
